              "t": "Senior leader in the IT Design and Research group."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "t": "As Design Partner: On paper this role is to work with executive leaders to anticipate and evaluate design needs then connect the right practitioners to the project. In practice, I am a professional Gap Filler: part design manager,strategist, coach, program manager, scrum master, and design lead — whatever is called for"
